{"id":"659632","name":"酸辣鸡丝","author":"好食光5965N","authorId":"13167702","desc":"","cover":"images/659632/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胸脯","amount":"2块"},{"name":"花生米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"3颗"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"糖","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1个"},{"name":"青辣椒","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备两块鸡胸脯，有一块小的一块做了。","img":"images/659632/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"清洗干净放锅中倒入料酒去腥，盖上盖子煮熟。","img":"images/659632/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮熟的鸡胸脯凉水清洗一下，用手撕成丝。","img":"images/659632/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"这样就好了，接下来我们准备配料。","img":"images/659632/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"清洗干净，洋葱青红辣椒大蒜洋葱香菜。","img":"images/659632/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"洋葱切成丝。","img":"images/659632/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"青红辣椒切成丝。","img":"images/659632/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"香菜切成段。","img":"images/659632/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大蒜切成沫。","img":"images/659632/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"昨天炒出来的花生米，今天正好用到啦。","img":"images/659632/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"全部倒入一个碗中。","img":"images/659632/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"起锅烧油，油烧热。","img":"images/659632/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入辣椒面，泼油。","img":"images/659632/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"油倒入，在放两勺白糖，搅拌即可。","img":"images/659632/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"完美🥰","img":"images/659632/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}